            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "FizzyKale7254"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I always make extra and freeze for next time. Also…reviewers knocking the addition of MSG should do their homework. The 1968 article ( meant as a joke) by Dr. Howard Steel has been debunked for decades. It is a verifiable fact MSG is harmless. And is used today in many foods to add that fifth basic taste. Umami.",
